@@section 1
@@title Storage Delight additions (storage_delight.md section 5)
@@jars storagedelight
@@text
@@text Needs `repackedStorage-25.12.09-1.19-forge-ce-19.2-01.jar` installed (`:repackedStorage:installToMods`).
@@text
@@table
## SQ-STD-01
@group B
@commands Boot a server with the jar and the pack's Quark; `/dumpall`
@pass No `storagedelight` error in `logs/latest.log`; 140 `storagedelight:` blocks, 50 of them new; the 50 recipes load (`storagedelight:` recipe ids for the 36 stone countertops and 14 bamboo blocks)
@fails Depends on: repackedStorage jar
@reviewed 2026-11-16
@absent storagedelight:bamboo_ (a registry regex prefix, not an id)
bootexpect Done \(
bootreject (?i)(ERROR|Exception).*storagedelight
> cdevtest reg block ^storagedelight: max=1
> cdevtest recipes storagedelight: max=1
> cdevtest reg block ^storagedelight:.*countertop max=1
> cdevtest reg block ^storagedelight:bamboo_ max=1
expect verb=reg kind=block regex=\^storagedelight: n=140$
expect verb=recipes text=storagedelight: n=([5-9]\d|\d{3,})
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=\S+ done=0
look recipe count at least the 50 new rows (36 stone countertops and 14 bamboo blocks: the countertop and bamboo reg counts); a different block count than 140: record it against storage_delight.md 5
