## SQ-STD-04 | Half cabinets registered, axe-mineable, 180 conversion recipes
@group B
@commands Boot; `cdevtest reg`, `cdevtest tag`, `cdevtest recipes`
@pass 230 `storagedelight:` blocks, 90 of them half cabinets; the halves in `minecraft:mineable/axe`; 90 split and 90 join recipes
@fails Depends on: repackedStorage jar -03, Creative Common jar (dict), pack script storage_delight.js
@reviewed 2026-11-23
bootexpect Done \(
bootreject (?i)(ERROR|Exception).*(storagedelight|storage_delight\.js)
> cdevtest reg block ^storagedelight: max=1
> cdevtest reg block half_cabinet max=1
> cdevtest recipes _from_half_cabinets max=1
> cdevtest recipes half_cabinet_with max=1
> cdevtest tag block minecraft:mineable/axe
expect verb=reg kind=block regex=\^storagedelight: n=230$
expect verb=recipes text=_from_half_cabinets n=90\b
expect verb=tag kind=block tag=minecraft:mineable/axe .*ids=\S*storagedelight:glass_oak_half_cabinet\b
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=\S+ done=0
look `reg block half_cabinet`: 90 storagedelight ids plus the 9 hearthandharvest ones (99); `recipes half_cabinet_with` counts the split recipes of the glass-door and countertop halves (the glass and single door halves end in `half_cabinet_from_cabinet`); a truncated axe tag id list: check the id by hand
