## CQ-STD-02
@group client
@commands `/give` one half cabinet of each style (glass, glass doors, single door, two countertops, bamboo and a nether wood among them); place against a wall in four facings, open and close, stack two in a column; craft one split and one join; JEI
@pass LOOK: each half sits against the block behind it (back half of the space), outline and collision match the model; front shows the whole full-cabinet front (open and closed), sides, top and bottom show the middle of the full cabinet's own textures (no purple, no new art); item icon centered like Hearth and Harvest's half cabinet; "Oak Half Cabinet with Glass Doors" style names; JEI lists each half right after its cabinet
@fails half_cabinet parent model UVs; HalfCabinetBlocks shape; order.js
@jars storagedelight
@draft client row: driver steps (give, use, screen, shot) not written
